   "source": [
    "# 01. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) — Dual Dataset Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook performs exploratory data analysis on the two telecom churn datasets:\n",
    "1. **IBM Telco Churn Dataset** (`Telco_customer_churn.xlsx`): ~7,043 customer records with churn labels, contract types, demographic info, and service subscriptions.\n",
    "2. **Cell2Cell Churn Dataset** (`cell2cellholdout.csv`): ~20,000 holdout records with rich behavioral metrics (monthly minutes, dropped calls, customer care calls, etc.)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "# Set plot styles\n",
    "plt.style.use('seaborn-v0_8-whitegrid' if 'seaborn-v0_8-whitegrid' in plt.style.available else 'default')
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Load IBM Telco Dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ibm_path = '../data/raw/Telco_customer_churn.xlsx'\n",
    "if os.path.exists(ibm_path):\n",
    "    df_ibm = pd.read_excel(ibm_path)\n",
    "    print(f\"IBM Telco Shape: {df_ibm.shape}\")\n",
    "    print(df_ibm['Churn Label'].value_counts(dropna=False, normalize=True))\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"File not found. Please verify data directory.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Load Cell2Cell Holdout Dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cell_path = '../data/raw/cell2cellholdout.csv'\n",
    "if os.path.exists(cell_path):\n",
    "    df_cell = pd.read_csv(cell_path)\n",
    "    print(f\"Cell2Cell Shape: {df_cell.shape}\")\n",
    "    print(df_cell['Churn'].value_counts(dropna=False))\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Cell2Cell dataset not found.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Schema Comparison & Feature Mapping Strategy\n",
    "- **IBM Telco** serves as the primary dataset for supervised churn classification because it has reliable target labels (`Churn Label`).\n",
    "- **Cell2Cell** contains zero labeled positive/negative targets in this holdout file, but provides realistic empirical distributions for call quality, support calls, and overage minutes.\n",
    "- Distribution matching simulates Cell2Cell behavioral metrics onto IBM Telco customers based on contract type & monthly charge percentiles."
   ]
  }
 ],
